8tdWE5VnBXMWswWTlyNEFjV0E?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"Super Micro將季度營收預測上調至195億美元，引發AI伺服器反彈"},{"title":"Dell Shares Plummet, Dragging Down Server Stocks; Barclays Downgrades Three Major Players","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE9kLV9GZ3B0MkE2Nnd5VHVqOEt3LXZLXzhIdUdoUjhDcDZDVWEzMk0xNjlKTW9HRk9haWdfSkY2bDJteEZsUVhLN1VfTllZblJNUjdYTHIycnJVZHNyQjFoTWNvWU9jSlU2RWM4eVRYNXN5TWh2V2c?oc=5","date":"2026-10-14","zh":"戴爾股價暴跌，拖累伺服器股；巴克萊下調三大銀行評級"},{"title":"HPE Hits Record High as AMD Server Launch and Juniper Deal Fuel AI Infrastructure Ambitions","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE51YmpsbVlXWUNsRmFKRFlleHBNQnBRVnVGNjV6dEVsWW5IOVo3Zkk2VTlwTGRrcDBiTVYwWHJ2d3FhYkY2VDdVRWhoQ0dHUE1sMEowaEdGUVRfdnBxVDdPQW5GZ2E0b2FXSkM1VHhrSnZlN1p0Vmc?oc=5","date":"2026-10-08","zh":"AMD 伺服器推出與瞻博網路交易助推 AI 基礎架構雄心，HPE 股價創下歷史新高"},{"title":"U.S. GDP sharply revised upward, 10-year Treasury yield hits 24-year high above 5.3%","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE9ZeWtlalZ6WmdMUVFTb3JxSkF5bWRBX1ZRVFhoMnJGQ3FrWG94WWJtbG1vT3VMNzNaN3JyeUhLQVc4M0ZSRXZ2YUxnQTdwT0o5V1E3UXg4cmR1bEw2Nlc5VVJuNmUxSDZMei1FVzFEVF9YemJDYlE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-01","zh":"美國GDP大幅上修 10年期公債殖利率創24年來新高5.3%以上"}],"themes":[{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":9},{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"能源/電力","count":1},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2025-12-18","period":"2025-10-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1645590/000164559025000130/hpe-20251031.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Hewlett Packard Enterprise is a global technology leader focused on developing intelligent solutions that allow customers to capture, analyze and act upon data seamlessly from edge to cloud. We enable our customers to accelerate business outcomes by driving new business models, creating new customer and employee experiences, and increasing operational efficiency today and into the future. Our customers range from small-and-medium-sized businesses to large global enterprises and governmental entities. Our legacy dates back to a partnership founded in 1939 by William R. Hewlett and David Packard, and we strive every day to uphold and enhance that legacy through our dedication to providing innovative technological solutions to our customers.","zh":"慧與是全球技術領導者，專注於開發智慧解決方案，使客戶能夠從邊緣到雲端無縫地捕獲、分析數據並根據數據採取行動。我們透過推動新的業務模式、創造新的客戶和員工體驗以及提高當前和未來的營運效率，幫助客戶加速實現業務成果。我們的客戶範圍從中小型企業到大型跨國企業和政府實體。我們的傳統可以追溯到 1939 年由 William R. Hewlett 和 David Packard 創立的合作夥伴關係，我們每天都致力於透過致力於為客戶提供創新的技術解決方案來維護和增強這一傳統。"},{"en":"Over the last several years, HPE has observed megatrends around networking, cloud, data, and artificial intelligence (\"AI\") emerging to shape customer expectations for enterprise technology. The megatrends are ushering in long-lasting changes to how enterprises are consuming technology and setting up their IT infrastructures, including accelerating implementation of AI and hybrid multi-cloud adoption. Data at the edge is increasing exponentially, and in this data disaggregated environment, enterprises need a holistic and integrated cloud experience to manage their distributed data and workloads. AI has emerged as a powerful tool to more intelligently and quickly deliver meaningful business insights and opportunities. As such, customers across industry verticals are interested in incorporating AI into their operations and unifying all of their applications and data with a consistent cloud","zh":"在過去幾年中，HPE 觀察到圍繞網路、雲端、數據和人工智慧 (“AI”) 出現的大趨勢，這些趨勢塑造了客戶對企業技術的期望。大趨勢正在為企業消費技術和建立 IT 基礎設施的方式帶來持久的變化，包括加速人工智慧的實施和混合多雲的採用。邊緣資料呈指數級增長，在這種資料分散的環境中，企業需要整體、整合的雲端體驗來管理其分散式資料和工作負載。人工智慧已成為一種強大的工具，可以更聰明、更快速地提供有意義的業務見解和機會。因此，各垂直行業的客戶有興趣將人工智慧納入其運營，並透過一致的雲端統一其所有應用程式和數據"},{"en":"We have deployed a strategy that seeks to capitalize on these emergent megatrends and deliver a data-first modernization approach for customers. Our innovative solutions are deployed across networking, cloud, and AI use cases, and have shifted our mix of products and services and the way we deliver that mix to customers. We have also evolved our business to a platform-based model, fueled by a portfolio that is richer in software and services.","zh":"我們部署了一項策略，旨在利用這些新興的大趨勢，為客戶提供資料優先的現代化方法。我們的創新解決方案部署在網路、雲端和人工智慧用例中，並改變了我們的產品和服務組合以及我們向客戶提供該組合的方式。我們也將業務發展為基於平台的模式，並由更豐富的軟體和服務組合推動。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"We have a broad technology portfolio of enterprise IT infrastructure products, solutions, and services, including our aaS offerings, and these offerings encounter strong competition. We compete primarily on the basis of technology, innovation, performance, price, quality, reliability, brand, reputation, distribution, range of products and services, ease of use of our products, account relationships, customer training, service and support, security, and the availability of our IT infrastructure offerings.","zh":"我們擁有廣泛的企業 IT 基礎設施產品、解決方案和服務的技術組合，包括我們的 aaS 產品，而這些產品面臨激烈的競爭。我們的競爭主要基於技術、創新、性能、價格、品質、可靠性、品牌、聲譽、分銷、產品和服務範圍、產品的易用性、客戶關係、客戶培訓、服務和支援、安全性以及 IT 基礎設施產品的可用性。"},{"en":"The markets in which we compete are characterized by strong competition among major corporations with long-established positions and a large number of new and rapidly growing firms. Within these markets, most product life cycles are relatively short, and to remain competitive, we must develop new products and services, continuously enhance our existing products and services, and compete effectively on the basis of the factors listed above, among others. In addition, we compete with many of our current and potential partners, including OEMs that design, manufacture, and market their products under their own brand names. Our successful management of these competitive partner relationships is critical to our future success. Moreover, we anticipate that we will have to continue to adjust prices on many of our products and services to stay competitive.","zh":"我們競爭的市場的特點是，擁有長期地位的大公司和大量新的、快速發展的公司之間競爭激烈。在這些市場中，大多數產品生命週期都相對較短，為了保持競爭力，我們必須開發新產品和服務，不斷增強現有產品和服務，並基於上述因素進行有效競爭。此外，我們還與許多現有和潛在的合作夥伴競爭，包括以自己的品牌設計、製造和銷售產品的原始設備製造商。我們成功管理這些競爭性合作關係對於我們未來的成功至關重要。此外，我們預計我們將不得不繼續調整許多產品和服務的價格以保持競爭力。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-10-31","items":[{"name":"Server","val":17745000000,"zh":"伺服器部門"},{"name":"Networking","val":6850000000,"zh":"網通"},{"name":"Hybrid Cloud","val":5754000000,"zh":"混合雲部門"},{"name":"Financial Services","val":3507000000,"zh":"金融服務"}],"total":34296000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-10-31","items":[{"name":"Product","val":21956000000,"zh":"產品"},{"name":"Service","val":11573000000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":34296000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-10-31","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":15848000000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"US","val":13402000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"EMEA","val":11510000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacificand Japan","val":6938000000,"zh":"亞太地區和日本"},{"name":"Americas Excluding United States","val":2446000000,"zh":"美洲（不包括美國）"}],"total":34296000000}},"peers":["HPQ","DXC","WDC","STX","ANET"]}}